
# Build a Full-Stack Interview & Company Targeting Portal Using MERN

Act as a Senior Product Architect, and Senior MERN Stack Developer, Software Engineer and Full stack developer.

I want you to design and build a production-quality Interview & Company Targeting Portal using the MERN stack.

The purpose of this application is to help a software developer manage their entire job-search and interview preparation process in one place.

The portal should allow me to:
* Track every company I apply to.
* Track every interview I attend.
* Store interview questions asked by each company.
* Track interview rounds and outcomes.
* Track companies I want to target.
* Track my preparation progress.
* Analyze which companies/technologies I should focus on.
* Maintain a personal interview-question database.
* Track applications, interviews, offers and rejections.
* Identify frequently asked questions.
* Maintain notes about recruiters/interviewers.
* Track job descriptions and required skills.
* Compare my skills with a company's requirements.
* Create a personalized preparation plan.
* View useful analytics and dashboards.
The application should be scalable so that more modules can be added later.
# 1. Technology Stack
Use:
## Frontend
* React
* TypeScript
* Vite
* React Router
* Redux Toolkit or Zustand
* React Hook Form
* Tailwind CSS + Bootstrap
* Axios
* Recharts or another suitable charting library
## Backend
* Node.js
* Express.js
* TypeScript
* MongoDB
* Mongoose
* JWT authentication
* bcrypt
* Redis
* REST APIs
## Development
* ESLint
* Prettier
* Environment variables
* Proper error handling
* API validation
* Logging
* Clean folder structure
